phrase: merge history at most capacity {limit} on list
phrase: consolidate merge history at most bound {limit} items
test: list=2,4,6,8,10 limit=3
expect: => i=12 r=0.0 ok=true s="merged history total: 12" errors=0 n=4 res=[2,4,6,12] cache=0 hits=0
